Decode combined-training clips with PyAV directly, producing identical tensors.

S2S_Dataset (models/train.py) reads every clip through pytorchvideo's
EncodedVideo.get_clip(0, video.duration), with the same per-clip overhead
patch 04 removes for WLASLDataset. This extends decode_clip to end_sec=None,
computing video.duration by pytorchvideo's own rule (the longer header
duration of the video and audio streams, else the last decoded frame), and
uses it in S2S_Dataset. Verified bit-identical before use (see README).

